[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Run 5bsd-imager as your normal desktop user. A running system D-Bus,
polkit service, and desktop authentication agent are required. Plasma's
polkit agent is suitable. The GUI never receives or stores passwords.

Version 0.2 supports .img, .iso, .raw, and XZ-compressed images and USB
mass-storage da disks. Unmount the target first. Active pools, swap, and
other open consumers are rejected. Source images must be bootable on
the target hardware; copying an arbitrary ISO does not make it bootable.
EOM
}
]
